{"unit_id":"Scorpiour__dsh-mingw#card-zh","repo":"Scorpiour/dsh-mingw","commit":"d1a3ac6c28d1dac891804136c703f5aca4d5998b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-win-mingw 是面向 Windows 的 DSH shell 插件：它在标准、PTC 和 Cordis preset 中接入 Git for Windows 自带的 MinGW bash，让命令使用 POSIX 语法、UTF-8 输出和 DSH 会话变量。插件会探测并验证 bash，可配置可执行文件路径及 PATH 前置目录，并保留 DSH shell 的超时和作业机制。适合希望在 Windows DSH 会话中使用 bash 命令行的开发者；需要 Windows 与 Git for Windows。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:28-40","executor.js:191-195","executor.js:238-270","mingw.js:186-247"]}
